    <briefdescription>
<para>Streaming ZSTD compressor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Compress an arbitrarily large data stream chunk by chunk without loading the entire input into memory at once.</para>
<para>Typical usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_zstd_stream_compressor_1a9c2fc3c1e46bbce04bc7f7ee062f255e" kindref="member">ZstdStreamCompressor</ref><sp/>enc(3);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(has_more_data())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>chunk<sp/>=<sp/>enc.compress_chunk(buf,<sp/>len);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(chunk)<sp/>write(*chunk);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>tail<sp/>=<sp/>enc.flush();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(tail)<sp/>write(*tail);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
